invalid type: string "Q: Can I use pre-ground coffee?\nA: Yes. Bypass the grinder by selecting 'Pre-ground' mode in the app or on the control panel, and add\nground coffee directly to the filter basket (about 1 tablespoon per cup).\nQ: Does the X200 work with Alexa?\nA: Yes. Enable the AuraBrew skill in the Alexa app and link your account. You can say, 'Alexa, ask\nAuraBrew to brew 4 cups.'\nÿÿÿÿÿ